 the *recursive* sequence ${a}_{n},$ given by\n\n$$\n{a}_{n+2}={a}_{n+1}+2{a}_{n},\\,{a}_{1}=2,\\,{a}_{2}=4,\\,n\\in N.\n$$\n\nLet's write down the first few terms of our sequence:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{a}_{1} & =2 \\\\ {a}_{2} & =4 \\\\ {a}_{3} & ={a}_{2}+2{a}_{1} \\\\  & =4+2(2) \\\\  & =8 \\\\ {a}_{4} & ={a}_{3}+2{a}_{2} \\\\  & =8+2(4) \\\\  & =16 \\\\ {a}_{5} & ={a}_{4}+2{a}_{3} \\\\  & =16+2(8) \\\\  & =32 \\\\  & ⋮\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, \n\n$$\nA={2,4,8,16,32,…}.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-181711/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "4e28c42e-0d82-5e82-a130-a2cb72fb96d1"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-181711"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-183668/selection/1cd1961116e7dc8e7d6ee6a9895167a7e4a1a5717c692307459bf5eef58565ab" :answer/id #uuid "4eb9796e-8e54-5977-9af5-248bf186ff31" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{0,-4,-16,-32,…}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-183668/selection/e370c7723e24553788b0ab690a56864746f267dba52fe743b5d8d255cfbe4fe1" :answer/id #uuid "937e7a90-00a7-587e-9bfc-ef5b2ffc9c6a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{0,-4,-16,-24,…}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-183668/selection/82f414076c999cb355a1cd60e60948e207654fe0f5a501a52e49b9d0aa2c56c4" :answer/id #uuid "d8b01960-6beb-5d1d-993f-a18dfc61e595" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{0,-4,-18,-12,…}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-183668/selection/0ad86b5cb4069bc2ba426e51454ba0ca5520772b0788bc23bac920564a4169fb" :answer/id #uuid "fae26ace-c7c0-586e-82c1-4874690048d9" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{0,-4,-16,-52,…}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-183668/selection/e7286fa28c8a561b19f238d13fa7d1ca4541cc8b610181b4e6ec4c58371a2bdb" :answer/id #uuid "6c661f42-df08-5ba3-8e12-814acb4bcf51" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{0,-4,-12,-24,…}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate